{
  "description": "Recovery tokens: base64(JSON(claims)) + \"--\" + hex(HMAC-SHA256(recovery_secret, encoded)), with claims {version, namespace, session_id, streams, purpose:\"recover\", expires_at}. The key is the dedicated recovery secret (ORBITCAST_RECOVERY_SECRET_BASE64 / Orbitcast.config.recovery_secret) and never the streams secret; the purpose is \"recover\" and never \"subscribe\". The fixed test secret below is shared with the signed-stream fixtures for convenience only - a real deployment never reuses a key across profiles. Tokens are Rust-generated (crate::recovery::RecoveryVerifier::sign); gem/lib/orbitcast/recovery.rb produces the same bytes for the same claims and key order, which gem/test asserts separately. A case may additionally carry input.verify_namespace: the deployment namespace a relay is configured with, which differs from the token's own; the relay refuses such a token with verify_error_kind even though its signature and claims are fine (src/recovery/tests.rs consumes that pair; tests/contract.rs and the gem verify the token against its own namespace).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "valid_recovery_token",
      "envelope": "token",
      "input": {
        "token": "eyJ2ZXJzaW9uIjoxLCJuYW1lc3BhY2UiOiJleGFtcGxlX3Byb2R1Y3Rpb24iLCJzZXNzaW9uX2lkIjoic2Vzc2lvbjo3Iiwic3RyZWFtcyI6WyJjaGF0OjQyIiwicG9zdHM6MSJdLCJwdXJwb3NlIjoicmVjb3ZlciIsImV4cGlyZXNfYXQiOjQxMDI0NDQ4MDB9--b30239027c5424fe8f79892eff36324790e3ee9f20a16366cfaa5e4c6fd3cecb",
        "secret": "test-secret-32-bytes-padded-000000",
        "now": 1760000000
      },
      "expect": {
        "valid": true,
        "signature_valid": true,
        "claims_valid": true,
        "claims": {
          "version": 1,
          "namespace": "example_production",
          "session_id": "session:7",
          "streams": [
            "chat:42",
            "posts:1"
          ],
          "purpose": "recover",
          "expires_at": 4102444800
        },
        "canonical": true,
        "authorizes": [
          "chat:42",
          "posts:1"
        ],
        "denies": [
          "chat:43",
          "secret:1"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "minted_for_another_deployment_is_refused_by_this_one",
      "envelope": "token",
      "input": {
        "token": "eyJ2ZXJzaW9uIjoxLCJuYW1lc3BhY2UiOiJvdGhlcl9hcHAiLCJzZXNzaW9uX2lkIjoic2Vzc2lvbjo3Iiwic3RyZWFtcyI6WyJjaGF0OjQyIl0sInB1cnBvc2UiOiJyZWNvdmVyIiwiZXhwaXJlc19hdCI6NDEwMjQ0NDgwMH0=--e43775753d993ca4e216d30329f50168b41e2a972671727b782beb48d529abbf",
        "secret": "test-secret-32-bytes-padded-000000",
        "now": 1760000000,
        "verify_namespace": "example_production"
      },
      "expect": {
        "valid": true,
        "signature_valid": true,
        "claims_valid": true,
        "claims": {
          "version": 1,
          "namespace": "other_app",
          "session_id": "session:7",
          "streams": [
            "chat:42"
          ],
          "purpose": "recover",
          "expires_at": 4102444800
        },
        "canonical": true,
        "authorizes": [
          "chat:42"
        ],
        "denies": [
          "posts:1"
        ],
        "verify_error_kind": "namespace_mismatch"
      }
    },
    {
